---
import BlockLayout from '../../../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import config from '../../../../data/art-v2-commerce.json';
import ArtPurchasePanel from '../../../../components/ArtPurchasePanel.astro';
const pendingArtwork = { id: '', source: { rightsStatus: 'pending' }, v2: { asset: null }, commerce: { priceMutez: config.priceMutez } };
---
<BlockLayout title="Art V2 · purchase and mint status" description="Collection preview with a planned 1 tez artwork price. Minting and purchase are not yet configured." isolated noindex alternates={[{ type: 'application/json', href: '/art/v2/commerce.json', title: 'Art V2 commerce status' }]}>
  <article class="commerce-page">
    <p>Art V2 gallery is being built.</p>
    <p class="eyebrow">Collection preview</p>
    <h1>Art V2 · 1 tez editions</h1>
    <p class="intro">The planned artwork price is 1 tez. No artwork in this collection is currently offered for purchase, and no minted inventory is claimed.</p>
    <ArtPurchasePanel artwork={pendingArtwork} />
    <h2>Mint status by network</h2>
    <div class="networks">
      <section><h3>Tezos</h3><p>Collection, tokens and listings are not configured. Artwork rights, seller authorization, edition limits, royalty terms and immutable storage are pending review.</p></section>
      <section><h3>PointCast blockchain</h3><p>A separate PointCast chain has not been verified. The existing PointCast marketplace runs on Tezos. A second-network mint needs a named network and verified configuration.</p></section>
    </div>
    <h2>Before a release</h2>
    <ol><li>Verify the original sources and rights for each new artwork.</li><li>Approve the seller and creator wallets, edition limits, royalty terms, collection and network.</li><li>Pin the final artwork and metadata, then have the owner review and execute minting and listing in their wallet.</li><li>Verify actual tokens, seller inventory, operator permissions and the exact 1 tez listing before enabling unsigned purchase preparation.</li></ol>
    <p>Every on-chain action needs the owner's wallet review. This preview does not sign or submit transactions. Network fees and any storage costs are additional; the wallet must show its estimate before signing.</p>
    <a href="/art/v2/commerce.json">Machine-readable release status</a>
  </article>
</BlockLayout>
<style>
  .commerce-page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.2rem 4rem; color: var(--text-primary, #171717); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: .5rem 0 1rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.4rem; } h3 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  p, li { line-height: 1.6; } .intro { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .eyebrow { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: .75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .networks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .networks section { border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: .75rem; padding: 1rem; }
  .networks p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .networks { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
